# React Engine Sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor U as Caller
    participant O as Agent Composer
    participant R as ReAct Engine
    participant OS as Memory
    participant MC as MCP
    participant L as LLM
    participant MS as MCP Servers

    U->>O: executeAgent()
    O->>R: run()

    %% Discover tools
    R->>MC: listTools()
    MC->>MS: tools/list
    MS-->>MC: tools
    MC-->>R: tool catalog

    %% Cache check
    R->>OS: check cache
    alt cache hit
        OS-->>R: cached response
        R-->>O: response
        O-->>U: result
    else cache miss
        R->>OS: load history

        %% Main loop
        loop until done
            R->>L: chat(messages, tools)
            L-->>R: response

            alt final answer
                R->>OS: save history
            else tool call
                R->>MC: callTool()
                MC->>MS: tools/call
                MS-->>MC: result
                MC-->>R: observation
                R->>OS: save history
            end
        end

        %% Finalize
        R->>R: build response
        R->>OS: save cache
        R-->>O: response
        O-->>U: result
    end
```
